{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:13 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d36d03e629bce50b13647183e769214f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_9_51_44_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>今日(26日)是宏福苑大火發生一周年，火災令168人離世，當中包括英勇殉職、並獲追授消防隊目的消防員何偉豪。其未婚妻Kiki今在社交平台上發表帖文，指自己在去年11月26日前曾經好幸福，但在大火發生後人生完全改變了，「但願有一天，168位和所有小動物的至親，我們……都能夠笑著提起最愛的他。」</p>\n<p>相關新聞︰宏福苑一周年︱四代同堂老街坊痛失好友 學生悼念：最大尊重是將悲劇銘記於心</p>\n<img alt=\"何偉豪未婚妻Kiki在社交平台發文悼念。（threads圖片)  \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4289e744538cb89dd5d8518d8b83844/2026-11/932115883_18000162243107049_7818929167309569147_n.jpg\" title=\"何偉豪未婚妻Kiki在社交平台發文悼念。（threads圖片)  \"/>\n<p>Kiki在帖文中指出，很羨慕去年11月26日前的自己，「因為我曾經好幸福，曾經有你(何偉豪)這個倚靠」，但在大火發生後的那天開發，自己的人生完全改變，「由那天開始，我的人生完完全全變了； 由那天開始，我的眼淚沒有停過； 由那天開始，我的衣服變成了黑色； 由那天開始，我最常去的地方變成了墓地。因為由那天開始，你不在我身邊了。」</p>\n<p>她亦提到，未婚夫何偉豪生前曾向她指「以後都要笑得咁開心！」，寄語「但願有一天，168位和所有小動物的至親，我們……都能夠笑著提起最愛的他。」</p>\n<img alt=\"今日(26日)是宏福苑大火發生一周年，有不少居民到來，以獻花悼念離世者。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47bb289a3a5a1bfdae128666ecdd8318/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_184906325_01_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"即使到了晚上，悼念人潮依然未減。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b92615a2364e23da8fe93d132af35a5/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_184906325_04_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f5eb5e9817d4e55d221d9715746f415/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_184906325_06_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10c54a09e05ab9fa37a233e721ed0bc7/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_184906325_10_2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/918e0f8a6382b39528509208a60a8458/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_184906325_11_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e48489decdee8e89f90a377e293fea48/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_184906325_17_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1b5e421c501dee423445621937e845f/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_184906325_24_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c57ea8e009ab78f0ae9e46de99743889/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_190237139_12_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f25ac3d8d5be68779e18270a7e2ddbe8/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_190727579_01_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7cc58a72d708369d47116dae97a6289/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_190727579_03_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03282e20e5706724bd9d7f5d0f31b962/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_190727579_05_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b048e6483bbc405442f56eccab9b35e/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_190727579_10_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56da078705b02c47414db2c5b8ddc4d9/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_190727579_15_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0abb8f9572514c1fba43e1d13c216d7d/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_190727579_17_1.jpg\"/>\n<h2>胞兄獻花悼亡弟：心仍在痛，淚繼續流</h2>\n<p>何偉豪胞兄今午亦在社交平台發文悼念亡弟。他透露，今日在浩園為弟弟打了周年齋，然後到了廣福休憩處，遠遠放下花束，「心仍在痛，淚繼續流。」</p>\n<img alt=\"何偉豪胞兄今午亦在社交平台發文悼念亡弟。（threads圖片)  \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40197c5c998b9473ae78d279929ce89b/2026-11/927397707_17955582996337544_1103430822960345955_n.jpg\" title=\"何偉豪胞兄今午亦在社交平台發文悼念亡弟。（threads圖片)  \"/>\n<p>有大批市民、 罹難者家屬及宏福苑災民由今早起前往廣福休憩處獻花悼念，即使入夜後人悼念人潮仍不減，現場一度聚集接近逾數百人。除了獻花，亦有人留下寫滿祝福與思念的字條，以表達對逝者的深切哀悼。</p>\n<img alt=\"有大批市民、 罹難者家屬及宏福苑災民由今早起前往廣福休憩處獻花悼念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17e687296b6a864603175b035e93bc78/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_06_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01d7c6f706e32286104618cb35152724/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_07_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b9c71009f95f1b1474e4c4ef28e7e07/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_08_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05e261515557255d6be9959c631d48c1/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_09_2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6ad14cc8f1b360d7655bd906b3ac9f2/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_10_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/215b8e3146b2c74df361d062dba3a4f4/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_11_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d89600a50846bb352d6a1525740dc79a/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_12_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27ee47e74c641d65bbdd776d4acb47cd/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_13_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df048b370575a9bc2a74e295ecfa0632/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_14_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db3a7bb76a1ced7e0d30022e1c2c6286/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_15_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05584fe1b0b5153529543362716d8964/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20261126_130815276_16_1.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:03:54.112013+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":630,"images":28,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:13:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:37:52.671096+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:57:25.728315+00:00","content_hash":"d714ac9e18e4e91cb80c18befe633004310a70c0e0d71b2dabd51dd674a4fdad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}